{"t":"2026-05-28T03:43:24.708Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01GhDESoBTRGj5HWpgrEVKbP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All logging uses `structlog` properly. The implementation is complete. Let me provide the final summary:\n\n---\n\n**Summary of what was built:**\n\nI created `backend/synthetics/scoring_runner.py` containing `ScoringSyntheticRunner.run_suite()` which:\n\n1. **Loads synthetic candidates** from the database using the UUIDv5 marker pattern (`WHERE id::text LIKE '00000000-%'`)\n\n2. **Loads JD fixtures** from `synthetics/fixtures/jobs/` (markdown files with YAML frontmatter declaring `expected_hot`, `expected_score_band`, and `target_candidate`)\n\n3. **Builds identity profiles** via `IdentityProfiler` with cache-aware instrumentation\n\n4. **Scores each candidate × JD pair** via `RelevanceScorer` with a wrapper client that:\n   - Adds `cache_control={\"type\": \"ephemeral\"}` to system prompts and candidate identity blocks\n   - Tracks `cache_creation_input_tokens` and `cache_read_input_tokens` from Claude API responses\n   - Records cache hit/miss statistics\n\n5. **Returns structured results** including:\n   - Per-candidate scoring results with actual vs. expected scores\n   - Per-candidate cache statistics\n   - Overall aggregated cache stats (total calls, hit rate, etc.)\n\n**Key design decisions:**\n- The FROZEN `RelevanceScorer` doesn't support `cache_control`, so I implemented a `CacheAwareAnthropic` wrapper that intercepts and augments Claude API calls\n- Uses Pydantic models for all data structures to ensure contract compliance\n- All logging via `structlog` (no `print()` statements)\n- Follows the exact contract shapes from NUTRIENTS.md §I.2-I.5\n\n**Files created:**\n- `backend/synthetics/__init__.py` — Module init exposing `ScoringSyntheticRunner`\n- `backend/synthetics/scoring_runner.py` — The runner implementation (763 lines)\n- `synthetics/runs/.gitkeep` — Empty file to preserve directory\n- `synthetics/runs/.gitignore` — Ignores JSON/log output files\n\n---\n\n[synthetics-scoring-agent.runner] FRUIT_READY — Built scoring runner that exercises synthetic candidates against job listings with performance tracking\n\nSynopsis: Built the system that tests fake job-seeker profiles against job listings and tracks how well the matching engine performs."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":427,"cache_read_input_tokens":108083,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":427,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a09f4fa-29b0-40d4-99d3-86bdcfeef6a7","uuid":"63b2784c-39c3-448b-831e-6814e7f7204f"}}
